{
 "id": "first-app",
 "icon": "👋",
 "title": {
  "en": "Your first FastAPI app",
  "ar": "تطبيقك الأول بـ FastAPI"
 },
 "summary": {
  "en": "Set up a project, write and run a minimal FastAPI app, add endpoints for each method, and explore the automatic docs.",
  "ar": "جهّز مشروعًا، واكتب تطبيق FastAPI بسيطًا وشغّله، وأضف endpoints لكل طريقة، واستكشف التوثيق التلقائي."
 },
 "lessons": [
  {
   "id": "setup-project",
   "title": {
    "en": "Setting up your project",
    "ar": "تجهيز المشروع"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🧰",
     "en": "Folder, venv, install, then code",
     "ar": "مجلد، venv، تثبيت، ثم الكود"
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Make a folder: `mkdir my-api`",
       "ar": "أنشئ مجلدًا: `mkdir my-api`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Create a venv: `python -m venv .venv`",
       "ar": "أنشئ venv: `python -m venv .venv`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Activate it: prompt shows `(.venv)`",
       "ar": "فعّلها: يظهر `(.venv)` في سطر الأوامر"
      },
      {
       "en": "Install `\"fastapi[standard]\"` with pip",
       "ar": "ثبّت `\"fastapi[standard]\"` باستخدام pip"
      },
      {
       "en": "Create an empty `main.py`",
       "ar": "أنشئ ملفًا فارغًا `main.py`"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "bash",
     "code": "mkdir my-api\ncd my-api\npython -m venv .venv\n\nsource .venv/bin/activate      # macOS / Linux\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate         # Windows",
     "highlight": [
      3,
      5,
      6
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "cards",
     "items": [
      {
       "icon": "📦",
       "color": "green",
       "title": {
        "en": "venv = private Python",
        "ar": "الـ venv = Python خاص"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "This project's packages never clash with others",
        "ar": "حزم هذا المشروع لا تتعارض مع غيره أبدًا"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "📄",
       "color": "blue",
       "title": {
        "en": "One file: main.py",
        "ar": "ملف واحد: main.py"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Your whole first app lives here",
        "ar": "تطبيقك الأول كله يعيش هنا"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "anatomy",
     "parts": [
      {
       "text": "pip install",
       "color": "blue",
       "label": {
        "en": "installer",
        "ar": "أداة التثبيت"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": " \""
      },
      {
       "text": "fastapi",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "the framework",
        "ar": "إطار العمل"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "[standard]",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "CLI + Uvicorn + tools",
        "ar": "الأمر fastapi + Uvicorn + أدوات"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "color": "purple",
       "label": {
        "en": "quotes protect the brackets",
        "ar": "التنصيص يحمي الأقواس"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "Plain `pip install fastapi` skips the `fastapi` command. Use `\"fastapi[standard]\"`.",
     "ar": "الأمر `pip install fastapi` وحده لا يثبّت الأمر `fastapi`. استخدم `\"fastapi[standard]\"`."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hello-app",
   "title": {
    "en": "Your first app and running it",
    "ar": "تطبيقك الأول وتشغيله"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🚀",
     "en": "Eight lines, one working API",
     "ar": "ثمانية أسطر، API كامل يعمل"
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "python",
     "code": "from fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\ndef read_root():\n    return {\"message\": \"Hello World\"}",
     "highlight": [
      3,
      6,
      8
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "anatomy",
     "parts": [
      {
       "text": "@app",
       "color": "purple",
       "label": {
        "en": "your app object",
        "ar": "كائن تطبيقك"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": ".get",
       "color": "blue",
       "label": {
        "en": "HTTP method",
        "ar": "طريقة HTTP"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "(\"/\")",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "the path",
        "ar": "المسار"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "text": "def read_root():",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "runs for GET /",
        "ar": "تُنفَّذ لطلب GET /"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "\n    "
      },
      {
       "text": "return {...}",
       "color": "cyan",
       "label": {
        "en": "dict sent as JSON",
        "ar": "قاموس يُرسل كـ JSON"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Run `fastapi dev main.py`",
       "ar": "شغّل `fastapi dev main.py`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Open http://127.0.0.1:8000 in a browser",
       "ar": "افتح http://127.0.0.1:8000 في المتصفح"
      },
      {
       "en": "See the JSON; terminal logs `200 OK`",
       "ar": "سترى الـ JSON، والطرفية تسجّل `200 OK`"
      },
      {
       "en": "Press Ctrl+C to stop",
       "ar": "اضغط Ctrl+C للإيقاف"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "text",
     "code": " Starting FastAPI in development mode\n Using import string: main:app\n Server started at http://127.0.0.1:8000\n    Documentation at http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs",
     "highlight": [
      3,
      4
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "GET /",
       "note": {
        "en": "browser asks the root",
        "ar": "المتصفح يطلب الجذر"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "200 OK  {\"message\":\"Hello World\"}",
       "note": {
        "en": "dict became JSON",
        "ar": "القاموس أصبح JSON"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "compare",
     "left": {
      "title": {
       "en": "fastapi dev",
       "ar": "fastapi dev"
      },
      "tone": "good",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "For development",
        "ar": "للتطوير"
       },
       {
        "en": "Auto-reloads when you save",
        "ar": "يعيد التحميل عند الحفظ"
       },
       {
        "en": "Listens on `127.0.0.1` only",
        "ar": "يستمع على `127.0.0.1` فقط"
       }
      ]
     },
     "right": {
      "title": {
       "en": "fastapi run",
       "ar": "fastapi run"
      },
      "tone": "neutral",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "For production",
        "ar": "للإنتاج (production)"
       },
       {
        "en": "No auto-reload",
        "ar": "بدون إعادة تحميل تلقائي"
       },
       {
        "en": "Listens on `0.0.0.0` (all interfaces)",
        "ar": "يستمع على `0.0.0.0` (كل الواجهات)"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "path-operations",
   "title": {
    "en": "Path operations",
    "ar": "عمليات المسار (Path operations)"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🛣️",
     "en": "Path + method = path operation",
     "ar": "مسار + طريقة = عملية مسار (path operation)"
    },
    {
     "type": "pills",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "@app.get",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "read",
        "ar": "قراءة"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "@app.post",
       "color": "blue",
       "label": {
        "en": "create",
        "ar": "إنشاء"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "@app.put",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "replace",
        "ar": "استبدال"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "@app.delete",
       "color": "red",
       "label": {
        "en": "delete",
        "ar": "حذف"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "python",
     "code": "@app.get(\"/books\")\ndef list_books():\n    return [{\"id\": 1, \"title\": \"Dune\"}]\n\n@app.post(\"/books\")\ndef add_book():\n    return {\"status\": \"added\"}\n\n@app.delete(\"/books\")\ndef delete_books():\n    return {\"status\": \"deleted\"}",
     "highlight": [
      1,
      5,
      9
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "POST /books",
       "note": {
        "en": "same path, other method",
        "ar": "المسار نفسه، طريقة أخرى"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "200 OK  {\"status\":\"added\"}",
       "note": {
        "en": "add_book ran",
        "ar": "نُفّذت add_book"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "cards",
     "items": [
      {
       "icon": "📘",
       "color": "blue",
       "title": {
        "en": "dict → object",
        "ar": "dict ← كائن JSON"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "`{\"a\": 1}` → `{\"a\":1}`",
        "ar": "`{\"a\": 1}` → `{\"a\":1}`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "📋",
       "color": "green",
       "title": {
        "en": "list → array",
        "ar": "list ← مصفوفة"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "`[\"x\", \"y\"]` → `[\"x\",\"y\"]`",
        "ar": "`[\"x\", \"y\"]` → `[\"x\",\"y\"]`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "🔤",
       "color": "yellow",
       "title": {
        "en": "str → quoted string",
        "ar": "str ← نص بعلامات تنصيص"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "`\"42\"` stays `\"42\"`, not the number `42`",
        "ar": "`\"42\"` يبقى `\"42\"`، وليس الرقم `42`"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "🔢",
       "color": "purple",
       "title": {
        "en": "number, bool, None",
        "ar": "رقم، bool، None"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "`42` → `42`, `True` → `true`, `None` → `null`",
        "ar": "`42` → `42`، `True` → `true`، `None` → `null`"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "warn",
     "en": "No decorator, no endpoint. Same method and path twice? The first one wins.",
     "ar": "بدون مزخرف (decorator) لا يوجد endpoint. نفس الطريقة والمسار مرتين؟ الأولى هي التي تفوز."
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "`def` and `async def` both work. Beginners: use `def`; `async def` only when you `await`.",
     "ar": "كل من `def` و`async def` يعمل. كمبتدئ استخدم `def`، و`async def` فقط عندما تستخدم `await`."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "not-found-and-not-allowed",
   "title": {
    "en": "Unknown paths and wrong methods",
    "ar": "المسارات المجهولة والطرق الخاطئة"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🚦",
     "en": "Free error replies, zero code",
     "ar": "ردود أخطاء مجانية بدون كود"
    },
    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "python",
     "code": "@app.post(\"/items\")\ndef create_item():\n    return {\"created\": True}",
     "highlight": [
      1
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "GET /nope",
       "note": {
        "en": "unknown path",
        "ar": "مسار مجهول"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "404 Not Found  {\"detail\":\"Not Found\"}",
       "note": {
        "en": "no such path",
        "ar": "لا يوجد هذا المسار"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "GET /items",
       "note": {
        "en": "right path, wrong method",
        "ar": "مسار صحيح، طريقة خاطئة"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "405 Method Not Allowed  {\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}",
       "note": {
        "en": "only POST lives here",
        "ar": "هنا POST فقط"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "POST /items"
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "200 OK  {\"created\":true}",
       "note": {
        "en": "match!",
        "ar": "تطابق!"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "pills",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "200",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "matched",
        "ar": "تطابق"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "404",
       "color": "red",
       "label": {
        "en": "path not found",
        "ar": "المسار غير موجود"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "405",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "method not allowed",
        "ar": "الطريقة غير مسموحة"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "compare",
     "left": {
      "title": {
       "en": "404 Not Found",
       "ar": "404 Not Found"
      },
      "tone": "bad",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "No endpoint has this path",
        "ar": "لا يوجد endpoint بهذا المسار"
       },
       {
        "en": "Body: `{\"detail\":\"Not Found\"}`",
        "ar": "الجسم: `{\"detail\":\"Not Found\"}`"
       }
      ]
     },
     "right": {
      "title": {
       "en": "405 Method Not Allowed",
       "ar": "405 Method Not Allowed"
      },
      "tone": "neutral",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "Path exists, not this method",
        "ar": "المسار موجود، لكن ليس لهذه الطريقة"
       },
       {
        "en": "Body: `{\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}`",
        "ar": "الجسم: `{\"detail\":\"Method Not Allowed\"}`"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "warn",
     "en": "Paths are case-sensitive: `/hello` exists, but `/Hello` gets 404.",
     "ar": "المسارات حساسة لحالة الأحرف: `/hello` موجود، لكن `/Hello` يحصل على 404."
    }
   ]
  },
