    {
     "type": "code",
     "lang": "json",
     "code": "{\n  \"openapi\": \"3.1.0\",\n  \"info\": {\"title\": \"FastAPI\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\"},\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"/\": {\"get\": {\"summary\": \"Read Root\", \"...\": \"...\"}}\n  }\n}",
     "highlight": [
      5
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "en": "Summary \"Read Root\" comes from the function name `read_root`. Good names, readable docs.",
     "ar": "الملخص \"Read Root\" مأخوذ من اسم الدالة `read_root`. أسماء جيدة تعني توثيقًا مقروءًا."
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "Test `POST`, `PUT` and `DELETE` in `/docs`: the address bar sends only `GET`.",
     "ar": "جرّب `POST` و`PUT` و`DELETE` من `/docs`: شريط العنوان لا يرسل إلا `GET`."
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "quiz": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "difficulty": "easy",
   "question": {
    "en": "Which command installs FastAPI together with the `fastapi` command and the server it needs?",
    "ar": "أي أمر يثبّت FastAPI مع الأمر `fastapi` والخادم الذي يحتاجه؟"
   },
   "codeSnippet": "",
   "options": [
    {
     "en": "pip install fastapi-server",
     "ar": "pip install fastapi-server"
    },
    {
     "en": "pip install \"fastapi[standard]\"",
     "ar": "pip install \"fastapi[standard]\""
    },
    {
     "en": "python -m fastapi install",
     "ar": "python -m fastapi install"
    },
    {
     "en": "pip install uvicorn-fastapi",
     "ar": "pip install uvicorn-fastapi"
    }
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "explanation": {
    "en": "`pip install \"fastapi[standard]\"` installs FastAPI plus the standard extras, including the `fastapi` CLI and the Uvicorn server.",
    "ar": "الأمر `pip install \"fastapi[standard]\"` يثبّت FastAPI مع الإضافات القياسية، ومنها أداة `fastapi` وخادم Uvicorn."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "difficulty": "easy",
   "question": {
